	<section_number>55.1-1424</section_number>
	<catch_line>When action for reentry brought</catch_line>
	<text>
		Proceedings for ejectment shall not be initiated until the time for reentry of the premises specified in the rental agreement has lapsed.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5535; Code 1950, § 55-244; 2019, c. 712.</history>
</law>
